Note on bundled data and imagery (NOT covered by the MIT license above):

- Submarine cable and landing-point data (public/data/cables.json,
  landing-points.json) © TeleGeography (submarinecablemap.com), used
  non-commercially with attribution. Re-fetch with `npm run data`.
- Planet and moon textures (public/textures/planets/) © Solar System Scope,
  CC BY 4.0 (solarsystemscope.com/textures).
- Country borders, place names (public/data/borders.json, places.json) from
  Natural Earth (public domain).
- Satellite orbital elements (public/data/satellites.json) from CelesTrak.
